    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρήστ-ης</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράστης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου,</span>
		
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράστας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worker,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				72
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεράπων, οὐ δράστας</span> as
			an attendant, not <i>a slave,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.287
			</span></i>; <i>doer, actor,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτουργὸς καὶ δράστης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.25h
				</span></i>
			.<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			Adj., <i>energetic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Man.
				5.85
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δραπέτης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
